WEBVTT

00:00:58.585 --> 00:01:00.989
I want to give you a demo of a prototype

00:01:00.989 --> 00:01:03.029
that we're working on that we'll launch later this fall.

00:01:03.029 --> 00:01:07.975
It will be completely free, and it will work in any browser.

00:01:07.975 --> 00:01:11.041
So, every Popcorn production begins with the video,

00:01:11.041 --> 00:01:13.427
and so I've made a short, 20-second clip

00:01:13.427 --> 00:01:17.178
using a newscaster template that we use in workshops.

00:01:17.178 --> 00:01:20.862
So let's watch it. We'll go back, and I'll show you how we made it.

00:01:20.862 --> 00:01:23.614
Hi, and welcome to my newscast.

00:01:23.614 --> 00:01:26.055
I've added my location with a Google Map,

00:01:26.055 --> 00:01:29.423
and it's live, so try moving it around.

00:01:29.423 --> 00:01:32.815
You can add pop-ups with live links and custom icons,